    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This one-acre site for sale is subject to planning permission. The subject site is located just outside Rathdrum village in a beautiful rural setting. The plot enjoys excellent road frontage and easy access. Its peaceful surroundings, combined with its convenient location close to the village, make this site an ideal opportunity for anyone wishing to build their own home.\r\n\r\nPlease note that this site is subject to section 47 local rule which means if you wish to build in the rural area you will have to\r\ndemonstrate that:\r\na) You have strong linkages to the area in which you want to build. This\r\nwill usually mean either a strong family linkage or a need to live in the area\r\nbecause of your employment. It should be noted to that being employed in\r\nthe rural area is not sufficient to demonstrate a 'need' to reside there.\r\n\r\nb) You are in 'need' of a dwelling in the rural area. If you currently own\r\nor have previously owned your own home, you will generally not be\r\nconsidered eligible for a new rural dwelling. However, there are exceptions\r\nto this rule and all circumstances will be taken into consideration."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Residential site offering an opportunity to self-build for a local applicant.\r\nSituated in the picturesque Rathdrum Countryside.\r\n4 Minutes Away from Rathdrum Village.\r\n15 Minute Drive to the N11 Exit 16.\r\nGood Road Frontage."
      },
